- Cosmisk: AI platform that creates ads (UGC, AI-generated, mashup ads). Sells to agencies.
- Smashed Agency: UGC ads agency powered by Cosmisk + AI agents. Proof that the system works.
- The flywheel: Agency proves Cosmisk → Cosmisk powers more agencies → More data → Better AI → More content';

